          <a href="https://www.finnovate.in/learn/blog/emergency-fund-india-3-6-12-rule" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Finnovate: Emergency Fund in India, the 3-6-12 Rule</a>
        </li>
        <li>
          EMI-to-salary affordability guidance, including the gap between bank-approved EMI limits and comfortable personal affordability.
          <a href="https://www.holisticinvestment.in/ideal-emi-to-salary-ratio-loan-planning/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Holistic Investment: Ideal EMI-to-Salary Ratio for Loan Planning</a>
        </li>
        <li>
          NFHS-5 (2019-21) data on marriage-age trends in India.
